                   <div className="relative z-10 space-y-8">
                      <div className="w-20 h-20 bg-red-600 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center text-white text-4xl font-black shadow-2xl border border-white/10">B</div>
                      <h3 className="text-5xl font-black italic uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.9]">Unlock the <br/><span className="text-red-600">Elite Manifest.</span></h3>
                      <p className="text-slate-400 font-medium text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-sm">Join the inner circle for priority deployments, exclusive recipes, and tactical rewards.</p>
